<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal ind prod rises 1.1 pct yr/yr in July.</title>
<headline>Portugal ind prod rises 1.1 pct yr/yr in July.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's index of industrial production rose 1.1 percent year-on-year in July, while month-on-month it rose 0.4 percent, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>					  Jul 96	Jun 96	Jul 95</p>
<p>General Index			  104.4	104.1	 103.3</p>
<p>Percentage change yr/yr	     +1.1	 +2.3</p>
<p>Percentage change mo/mo	     +0.4	 +1.7</p>
<p>Accumulated 12 months		 +2.1	 +2.4</p>
<p>Base Year = 1985</p>
<p>				July 96  June 96  July 95</p>
<p>Mining industry	    81.2     97.9     83.3</p>
<p>Manufacturing industry  100.6    101.6    102.1</p>
<p>Energy			126.0    116.0    112.1</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
